#: ../../005_mcp.md:1
msgid "Using FCS with AI Assistants (MCP)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:3
msgid ""
"Starting with FCS 26.10, FCS can provide a local Model Context Protocol "
"(MCP) server. An MCP-compatible AI assistant can inspect the current FCS "
"session, operate supported workflows, and read the bundled FCS operating "
"guide. AI assistants can directly help you the time consuming part of "
"your tasks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:6
msgid "Before You Start"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:8
msgid "You need:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:10
msgid ""
"FCS 26.10 or later with a valid license, running on the same computer as "
"the AI assistant."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:11
msgid "An MCP client that supports Streamable HTTP servers on the local computer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:13
msgid ""
"FCS must remain open and licensed while the assistant working on it. The "
"MCP server listens only on `127.0.0.1`, so it is not available to other "
"computers or to cloud-only assistants."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:15
msgid "Enable the MCP Server"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:17
msgid ""
"Launch FCS normally. The procedure is the same for the installed FCS "
"executable and for a Python/script launch."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:19
msgid "Open **Settings** and expand **MCP Server**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:20
msgid "Enable **Enable MCP Server**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:21
msgid ""
"Keep the default port, `19877`, unless it conflicts with another local "
"program."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:23
msgid "Save the settings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:24
msgid ""
"Confirm that the status displays **Listening at "
"http://127.0.0.1:19877/mcp**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:27
msgid ""
"Use the complete URL shown by FCS when configuring a client. If you "
"change the port, use the updated URL in every client configuration. Port "
"`19876` is reserved by FCS and cannot be used for MCP."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:31
msgid "Connect an AI Assistant"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:33
msgid ""
"The setup is performed once for each assistant. Name the server `fcs` or "
"`FCS` and use the URL displayed in FCS."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:36
msgid "ChatGPT Desktop and the Codex App"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:38
msgid "Open **Settings > Plugins > MCP**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:39
msgid "Select **Add server**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:40
msgid "Enter `FCS` as the name and select **Streamable HTTP**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:41
msgid "Enter `http://127.0.0.1:19877/mcp` as the URL."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:42
msgid "Save the server and restart the app when prompted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:44
msgid ""
"This applies to local ChatGPT/Codex clients that support custom MCP "
"servers. ChatGPT in a web browser cannot connect directly to the FCS "
"loopback address."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:47
msgid "Codex CLI"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:49 ../../005_mcp.md:60
msgid "Run:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:55
msgid ""
"Use `codex mcp list` to check the connection. Inside Codex, use `/mcp` to"
" view the connected server and its tools."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:58
msgid "Claude Code"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:66
msgid ""
"The user scope makes FCS available in future Claude Code sessions on this"
" computer. Run `claude mcp list` to check the connection."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:69
msgid "Visual Studio Code and GitHub Copilot"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:71
msgid "Open the Command Palette with **Ctrl+Shift+P**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:72
msgid "Run **MCP: Add Server**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:73
msgid "Select **HTTP**, enter the FCS URL, and name the server `FCS`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:74
msgid ""
"Choose the global/user profile location so that the connection is "
"available outside one workspace."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:76
msgid ""
"Open Chat and use **Configure Tools** to confirm that the FCS tools are "
"available."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:79
msgid "OpenCode"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:81
msgid "Add a remote MCP server to the OpenCode configuration:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:98
msgid ""
"FCS does not require OAuth because the endpoint is restricted to the "
"local computer. Check the MCP server list in OpenCode after saving the "
"configuration."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:101
msgid "Claude Desktop"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:103
msgid ""
"Claude Desktop custom connectors are intended for remotely reachable "
"servers and cannot be assumed to reach FCS at `127.0.0.1`. FCS currently "
"does not ship the separate stdio bridge required by Claude Desktop's "
"traditional local MCP configuration. Use Claude Code or another local "
"Streamable HTTP client instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:109
msgid "Available Workflows"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:111
msgid "The public MCP tools cover these areas:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:113
msgid ""
"Application and session status, session creation, opening, inspection, "
"and saving."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:115
msgid "Video import, library and sequence browsing, and video selection."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:116
msgid "Single and batch processing, job progress, status, and cancellation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:117
msgid "Export validation, export defaults, and session export."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:118
msgid "Renderer status, connection testing, launch, and scene opening."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:119
msgid "Processing profiles and settings inspection or updates."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:120
msgid ""
"ROM gallery queries, updates, prediction, deletion, and timeline "
"navigation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:121
msgid ""
"Controller inspection, editing, presets, reordering, synchronization, and"
" explicit saving."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:124
msgid ""
"FCS intentionally exposes a curated set of named tools. License "
"management and internal application commands are not available through "
"MCP. The exact tool list is discovered automatically by the client when "
"it connects."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:128
msgid "Example conversations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:130
msgid ""
"After connecting, speak to the assistant normally. You do not need to "
"memorize MCP tool names. The assistant can also read the FCS operating "
"guide exposed through MCP before acting. Representative exchanges:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:139 ../../005_mcp.md:165
msgid "**User**"
msgstr "**User**"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:141
msgid "セッションを作成したいです．どのような情報を提示すればよいですか？"
msgstr "I want to create a session. What information should I provide?"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:146 ../../005_mcp.md:183
msgid "**Assistant**"
msgstr "**Assistant**"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:148
msgid "セッション作成には以下の6点が必要です："
msgstr "Session creation requires the following six items:"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:150
msgid "**project_folder**: プロジェクトフォルダの絶対パス"
msgstr "**project_folder**: Absolute path to the project folder"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:151
msgid "例: `D:/FacialCapture/MyProject`"
msgstr "Example: `D:/FacialCapture/MyProject`"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:152
msgid "**actor**: アクター名（撮影対象人物、スペースなし推奨）"
msgstr "**actor**: Actor name (the captured person; spaces not recommended)"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:153
msgid "**character**: キャラクター名（動かす3Dリグ名）"
msgstr "**character**: Character name (the 3D rig to drive)"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:154
msgid "**maya_scene**: Mayaシーンファイルの絶対パス（`.ma` / `.mb`、実在必須）"
msgstr ""
"**maya_scene**: Absolute path to the Maya scene file (`.ma` / `.mb`; must"
" exist)"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:155
msgid ""
"**maya_base**: "
"Mayaワークスペースフォルダの絶対パス（`workspace.mel`があるフォルダ、通常はscene選択で自動検出）"
msgstr ""
"**maya_base**: Absolute path to the Maya workspace folder (the folder "
"that contains `workspace.mel`; usually detected automatically when a "
"scene is selected)"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:156
msgid "**maya_version**: Mayaバージョン（`2020, 2022, 2023, 2024, 2025`から選択）"
msgstr ""
"**maya_version**: Maya version (choose from `2020, 2022, 2023, 2024, "
"2025`)"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:158
msgid "既存プロジェクトフォルダを指定いただければ、利用可能なactor/character一覧もこちらで確認できます。"
msgstr ""
"If you specify an existing project folder, I can also check the available"
" actor/character list for you."

#: ../../005_mcp.md:160
msgid "上記6点を教えていただけますか？"
msgstr "Could you provide those six items?"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:167
msgid "以下の情報で複数のセッションを作成し動画をインポートしてください。"
msgstr ""
"Please create multiple sessions with the following information and import"
" the videos."

#: ../../005_mcp.md:169
msgid "**project_folder**: `D:/FacialCapture/SampleProject/Sessions`"
msgstr "**project_folder**: `D:/FacialCapture/SampleProject/Sessions`"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:170
msgid "**actor** / **character** / **maya_scene**:"
msgstr "**actor** / **character** / **maya_scene**:"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:171
msgid ""
"撮影動画は `D:/FacialCapture/SampleCapture/RecData` に、アクターごとに "
"キャラクター名を含んだ名前で動画が格納されている"
msgstr ""
"Captured videos are stored under "
"`D:/FacialCapture/SampleCapture/RecData`, organized by actor, with "
"filenames that include the character name"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:173
msgid "Maya シーンは `D:/FacialCapture/SampleCapture/Scenes` に、キャラクターごとに格納されている"
msgstr ""
"Maya scenes are stored under `D:/FacialCapture/SampleCapture/Scenes`, "
"organized by character"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:174
msgid "対応関係が取れる組み合わせのみでセッションを作成すること"
msgstr "Create sessions only for combinations that match"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:175
msgid "**maya_base**: `D:/FacialCapture/SampleCapture/Scenes`"
msgstr "**maya_base**: `D:/FacialCapture/SampleCapture/Scenes`"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:176
msgid ""
"**maya_version**: `2024` のはずだが、可能であれば各 `maya_scene` "
"をテキストとして開き、1行目の記述を確認すること"
msgstr ""
"**maya_version**: should be `2024`, but if possible open each "
"`maya_scene` as text and confirm the first line"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:178
msgid ""
"その後、対応する動画をインポートする。各アクターの動画フォルダに `ROM` "
"と名の付く動画があれば、それをそのアクターのセッションすべてにインポートする。"
msgstr ""
"Then import the matching videos. If any actor video folder contains a "
"video with `ROM` in the name, import that video into every session for "
"that actor."

#: ../../005_mcp.md:185
msgid "完了しました。3つの FCS セッションを作成し、対応動画と ROM 動画をインポート済みです。"
msgstr ""
"Done. Created three FCS sessions and imported the matching videos and ROM"
" videos."

#: ../../005_mcp.md:193
msgid ""
"各メイン Maya シーンの先頭行は `//Maya ASCII 2024 scene` で、Maya 2024 として作成しました。Carol "
"は対応するシーン/キャラクターが見つからなかったため、セッションを作成していません。"
msgstr ""
"The first line of each main Maya scene was `//Maya ASCII 2024 scene`, so "
"the sessions were created as Maya 2024. Carol was skipped because no "
"matching scene/character was found."

#: ../../005_mcp.md:195
msgid ""
"作成先は `D:/FacialCapture/SampleProject/Sessions/FCS/` です。現在は `Bob / "
"Extra_001` セッションを開いた状態です。"
msgstr ""
"They were created under `D:/FacialCapture/SampleProject/Sessions/FCS/`. "
"The `Bob / Extra_001` session is currently open."

#: ../../005_mcp.md:199
msgid "Review Actions Before Approval"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:201
msgid ""
"Your MCP client may request approval before a tool runs. Read the "
"proposed action carefully, particularly before allowing an assistant to:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:204
msgid "Delete ROMs or cancel processing jobs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:205
msgid "Change and save application settings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:206
msgid "Save a session or controller table."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:207
msgid "Start processing or export files."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:209
msgid ""
"Prefer asking the assistant to inspect or validate first, summarize the "
"planned changes, and perform the mutation only after you approve it. "
"Controller edits remain a working draft until the assistant explicitly "
"saves them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:213
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:215
msgid "FCS shows Disabled"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:217
msgid ""
"Enable **MCP Server** in Settings and save. Merely changing the checkbox "
"without saving does not apply the setting."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:220
msgid "FCS shows Waiting for a valid license"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:222
msgid ""
"Complete FCS license activation. The endpoint starts only while the "
"license is valid."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:225
msgid "FCS shows an error or the port is already in use"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:227
msgid ""
"Choose another port from `1024` through `65535`, except `19876`, save the"
" settings, and update the URL in the AI assistant."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:230
msgid "The assistant cannot connect"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:232
msgid ""
"Confirm that FCS is still open, its status says **Listening**, and the "
"client URL exactly matches the status URL, including `/mcp`. A client "
"running on another computer, in a remote development environment, or only"
" in the cloud cannot reach the FCS `127.0.0.1` endpoint."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:237
msgid "The assistant connects but an action is rejected"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:239
msgid ""
"Check that the FCS license is still valid. The requested operation may "
"also be outside the curated public tool set or may require an open "
"session, selected video, renderer connection, or other FCS state. Ask the"
" assistant to inspect the application and session status before retrying."
msgstr ""

